## AXIOMS UPDATE (additions to B0)

```yaml
A7: "CAT is the routing key. CogeBridge.execute(intent) must resolve via CatRegistry, not raw string match."
A8: "CapacityOrch gates EVERY Brain call. BrainTier is never hardcoded."
A9: "Soul = SKB profile registry. Activate/deactivate on workspace switch. NOT monolithic."
A10: "LoRA tuning pipelines FROZEN. fem/lora structural code preserved. No adapter injection scripts."
A11: "SIO is the only cross-boundary currency. NIO exits at Coge input gate only."
```

---

## ERA-5 SYSTEM TOPOLOGY (update to B1)

```
HI -- NIO -->
  COGE (TEE local, 0.5-1B)
    CatRegistry::resolve(ns,cmd)   -> CatManifest
    CapacityEstimator::score(sio)  -> BrainTier
    SkbHydrator::hydrate(sio_v1)   -> SIO_v2
    BrainRouter::dispatch(sio_v2)  -> TeleportPlan
    CatRenderer::render(plan, surf) -> HI_output
      |
  SOUL REGISTRY (Multi-profile SKB)
    dev-soul.skb | gov-soul.skb | runtime-soul.skb | biz-soul.skb
    hot-plug (<5ms), active_profiles -> SkbBundle -> SIO_v2.context
      |
  CAPACITY ORCH (no_std Rust gate)
    score(graph_nodes, authority, apa_budget) -> BrainTier
      |
  ZEUS BRAIN (selected tier)
    base.gguf (FIXED) + cosda.lro (SKILL patterns)
    -> TeleportPlan {goal, tasks[], execution_order}
      |
  AURA ORCH
    decompose(plan) -> SubDecree[] -> parallel sub-agents
      |
  NKC TRIAL -> ConformanceResult -> Coge render -> HI

FROZEN_LAYER (structural preserved, active dev halted):
  fem/lora   -- LoRA/DoRA/SLoRA skeleton (FROZEN)
  fem/kvm    -- KV Cache skeleton (FROZEN, unblocked when LoRA resumes)
  brain/coge/lora.rs -- deprecated, keep #[deprecated] marker
```

