## ALPHA-3 PRIORITY REORDER (era-5)

```yaml
old_order:
  P0: GGUF runtime truth
  P1: LRO overlay runtime
  P2: ZES enforcement
  P3: KV fusion
  P4: SKB hydration

new_order:
  P0: CAT parser complete + CatRegistry (CP1+CP2 from csa-cat-blueprint)
  P1: Coge dispatcher real + CatRenderer (CP3+rendering)
  P2: SKB hydration wire soul/orch -> fem/skb (CP3 from v1)
  P3: CapacityOrch no_std (CP4 from csa-cat-blueprint)
  P4: SoulRegistry hot-plug (CP5 from csa-cat-blueprint)
  P5: GGUF runtime truth (retained G1, now P5)
  P6: LRO overlay (FROZEN until P0-P4 complete)

rationale: >
  The CAT+Coge+SKB layer is the prerequisite routing surface.
  GGUF inference at P5 is still required for the full stack,
  but a working brain with stub inference + real CAT routing + real SKB hydration
  is more architecturally correct than a real inference engine with no routing surface.
  LoRA resumes naturally after P0-P4 deliver the context injection infrastructure.
```

