## IMPLEMENTATION SEQUENCE (era-5 CTO order)

```yaml
sprint_1_cat_core: # 3h
  - fem/cat/src/parser.rs     : full YAML contract parse
  - fem/cat/src/lib.rs        : InputSpec -> HashMap<String,FieldSpec>
  - fem/cat/src/registry.rs   : CatRegistry::scan_dir + resolve
  deliverable: AilParser + CatRegistry usable

sprint_2_coge_real: # 4h
  - brain/coge/src/cat_dispatcher.rs : real AilParser + CatRegistry dispatch
  - brain/coge/src/mod.rs            : route via CatRegistry not raw match
  - fem/cat/src/renderer.rs          : CatRenderer per surface
  - brain/coge/src/renderer.rs       : Coge render bridge
  deliverable: "hace brain model.verify" dispatches via real CAT manifest

sprint_3_capacity: # 3h
  - brain/capacity/src/lib.rs  : CapacityOrch (no_std, score + APA + tier)
  - brain/coge/src/capacity.rs : wire into CogeBridge.execute()
  deliverable: dynamic brain tier selection operational

sprint_4_soul_registry: # 4h
  - soul/registry/src/lib.rs   : SoulRegistry activate/deactivate/bundle
  - soul/profiles/*.skb.ail    : initial SKB profile files
  - brain/coge/src/hydrator.rs : SkbHydrator SIO_v1 -> SIO_v2
  deliverable: multi-soul hot-plug + context hydration

sprint_5_gguf_truth: # 6h (previously P0, now P5)
  - fem/hacedle/x/loader/gguf/loader_std.rs : real tensor mmap parse
  - fem/hacedle/src/lib.rs                  : BrainKernel trait impl
  - brain/master/bridges/hacedle.rs         : real invoke() -> HacedleEngine
  deliverable: first real inference token

total_estimate: ~20h focused implementation
era5_ready_after: sprint_4 (Cat+Coge+SKB+CapOrch all wired)
full_alpha3_after: sprint_5 (GGUF truth + era-5 stack)
```

